---
import { SITE, NAV } from '../consts';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const span = year > SITE.since ? `${SITE.since}–${year}` : `${SITE.since}`;
---

<footer class="colophon">
  <div class="colophon__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="label">이곳에 대하여</p>
      <p class="colophon__note">
        {SITE.description}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="label">차례</p>
      <ul>
        {NAV.map((item) => <li><a href={item.href}>{item.label} <span style="opacity:.55">{item.sub}</span></a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="label">바깥으로</p>
      <ul>
        {
          SITE.links.map((l) => (
            <li>
              <a href={l.href} rel={l.href.startsWith('http') ? 'me noopener' : undefined}>
                {l.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="label">판권</p>
      <p class="colophon__note">
        본문 활자는 <span style="font-family:var(--font-serif)">고운바탕</span>, 표제는
        <span style="font-family:var(--font-display)">함렛</span>.<br />
        글은 <a class="link" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.ko" rel="noopener">CC BY 4.0</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="colophon__bottom">
    <span class="label">© {span} {SITE.author}</span>
    <span class="label">Seoul · 서울</span>
  </div>
</footer>
